5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Since it's the first day, let's all try to get along! Does anyone have any ideas on how we should find the werewolf?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Getting along is fine, but we should focus on logic. I suggest we observe everyone's speech patterns and contradictions carefully.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shion. Intuition is unreliable in a game like this; we need to rely on consistent evidence and logical deductions.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,Wisdom often comes from listening. Let us be patient and observe how each of you reacts to the pressure of the coming days.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm with everyone! Let's just be honest and help each other out. I'm sure we can find the werewolf if we all work together!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I wonder if anyone is already feeling nervous? @Shion, you seem really confident, which is cool, but maybe a bit too calm?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Confidence is simply a byproduct of a clear mind, Kenji. Being nervous wouldn't help us identify the werewolf, would it?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"It is true that composure is an asset, but Kenji's observation is a valid starting point. We should note who is trying too hard to appear natural.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the mask one wears can be as telling as the words they speak. Let us see who maintains their poise as the stakes rise.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"I think Shion is just being himself! But let's keep an eye on everyone, just in case. I'm sure we'll figure it out together!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll do my best to keep a close eye on everything! Does anyone have any specific questions they want to ask the others before the day ends?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,I don't have any questions yet. I'm more interested in seeing how you all react once the first night's results are revealed tomorrow.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I have no questions for now. I will spend this time analyzing the current dynamics and preparing for the information we will receive tomorrow.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"I shall also remain silent for now. Sometimes the most profound truths are revealed not through questioning, but through the natural flow of conversation.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I don't have any questions either! I'm just excited to see how we all handle this. Let's all have a good night's sleep!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Good night, everyone! I'll be thinking hard about who might be the werewolf while I sleep. See you all tomorrow!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Sleep well, Kenji. I look forward to seeing how your ""thinking"" translates into action tomorrow.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will be doing the same. Good night.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Servas,,May the night bring clarity to our minds and peace to our hearts. Good night.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Good night, everyone! Sweet dreams, and let's all wake up safe tomorrow morning!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
