31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, good morning! I have some really important information to share... I'm the Seer, and I checked Shion last night. He's the werewolf!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That is a bold claim to make so early, Kenji. It's a classic strategy for a werewolf to fake being the Seer to frame an innocent player. I am, of course, human.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"This is a critical moment. If Kenji is the Seer, we have our target. However, if Kenji is the werewolf, he is attempting to eliminate Shion immediately. We must weigh the risk.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,"A sudden revelation indeed. Kenji, your courage is commendable, but we must consider if this is a genuine discovery or a calculated deception to sow discord.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Wait, really?! Shion is the werewolf? I can't believe it! But Kenji seems so honest... I don't want to believe it, but we have to trust the Seer, right?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not lying! I really am the Seer! Shion is definitely the werewolf, and if we don't vote for him now, he'll just kill more of us tonight!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Your desperation is showing, Kenji. By rushing us into a vote, you're trying to prevent us from thinking logically. If I were the werewolf, would I really be this calm in the face of such a blatant lie?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Calmness can be a facade, Shion. However, Kenji, your urgency is also a common trait of those trying to force a result. We need to determine who is more likely to be lying here.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Let us consider the possibility that the Seer has spoken. If Kenji is truthful, the threat is immediate. If he is not, he has just painted a target on his own back for the future.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I just want us to find the right person! @Kenji, are you absolutely sure? I trust you, but this is so scary! What should we do?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm absolutely sure! I saw it with my own eyes! @Yumi, please trust me! If we let Shion live, he'll just kill another one of us tonight! We have to vote for him!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, look at how he's manipulating your emotions. He's not using logic; he's using fear. If you follow his lead blindly, you're simply playing into the hands of a liar.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The conflict is now a binary choice between Kenji and Shion. If we execute Shion and he is human, we lose a member and the werewolf remains. If we spare him and he is the werewolf, we lose another person tonight.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy burden to decide a life on such a divide. However, the Seer's role is to provide the light that guides us through the darkness. If Kenji is indeed that light, we cannot afford to ignore him.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I really don't want to make a mistake, but Kenji has been so positive and helpful... I think I have to believe him! I'm sorry, Shion, but I think we should trust the Seer!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Thank you, Yumi! Everyone, please, let's not let the werewolf trick us with fancy words. Shion is the one! Let's vote for him and save the village!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,"It is a pity that you all prefer a child's emotional plea over logical scrutiny. If you choose to execute me, you are merely clearing the path for the real werewolf to win.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I have analyzed the arguments. While Shion's logic is consistent, the risk of ignoring a genuine Seer's revelation is too high. I will cast my vote for Shion.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I have listened to both sides. While the truth is often veiled, the risk of ignoring the Seer's warning outweighs the risk of a mistake. I shall join the majority in this decision.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so sorry, Shion, but I have to trust Kenji! Let's all vote for Shion to keep everyone safe!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
